The decode table in src/decode/generated.rs and the templates in
src/lift/generated/*.rs are generated from the MIPS part of the Sail model
of CHERI-MIPS in CTSRD-CHERI/sail-cheri-mips (directory mips, commit
13a9c3fb0c3f8d320d4f4650a63d23d3a8b12724), and use the Sail library of
rems-project/sail (commit c44944f11b71e5c9bd4b30cdbf79ea32f6dcf456).
